### 11. SALES & OWNERSHIP RECORDS
### ==========================================

### 11.1 Finalize Sale (Staff/Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apartmentId": "1",
  "finalPrice": 28500000,
  "customerEmail": "sarah.chen@email.com"
}

### 11.2 Get All Sales Records (Staff/Admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}

